<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Apollo on 豌豆多多</title><link>/tags/apollo/</link><description>Recent content in Apollo on 豌豆多多</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 19 May 2020 15:06:21 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/tags/apollo/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>详解统一配置中心平台：Apollo服务搭建</title><link>/post/%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B9%8Bapollo%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2020 15:06:21 +0800</pubDate><guid>/post/%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B9%8Bapollo%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="简介">简介
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Apollo（阿波罗）是携程框架部门研发的分布式配置中心，能够集中化管理应用不同环境、不同集群的配置，配置修改后能够实时推送到应用端，并且具备规范的权限、流程治理等特性，适用于微服务配置管理场景。本文就详细讲解了Apollo这一统一配置中心的搭建过程。&lt;/p>
